#QLCIR-G1
# name: interferometer_grouped_k3_s1_d3
# family: physics/grouped-interferometer
# expected: SAT
# physical: Abstract multi-slit/interferometer coarse-graining; only proposition structure is encoded, not amplitudes or phases.
# note: 3-path event coarse-grained into groups of 1 and 2 paths; psi belongs to the total event but is not classically reconstructed from the two coarse pieces.
dim(3)
output(7)
1 = or(path1, path2)
2 = or(path0, 1)
3 = and(psi, path0)
4 = and(psi, 1)
5 = or(3, 4)
6 = not(5)
7 = and(psi, 2, 6)
